  "label": "User projected onto the scenario of having a pet as a substitute for human interaction",
  "description": "The user is implicitly projected onto the meme's message, which suggests that one does not need human interaction because they have a loyal animal companion. The text 'who needs a human interaction' and 'got a loyal animal companion' frames the scenario as something the user might identify with, even though no explicit 'you' or 'me' is present. The user is projected onto the idea that pet companionship fulfills emotional needs, which is the core message of the meme.",
